translate english ch0_a100fb12:

    # "………………嗯……？"
    "......Hmm...?"

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:28
translate english ch0_4bf3ecad:

    # "——刚才的，不是我自己的声音。"
    "— That just now, it wasn't my own voice."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:29
translate english ch0_c4485879:

    # "有些沙哑的女声声音不大，却像惊雷一样在我的耳畔炸开。"
    "The hoarse female voice was not loud, but it exploded in my ears like thunder."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:30
translate english ch0_584d92b3:

    # "所以房间里还有另一个人存在？"
    "So there was someone else in the room?"

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:31
translate english ch0_b5306006:

    # "可我却完全没注意到……怎么回事？"
    "But I didn't notice it at all... What's going on?"

