# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:34
translate english ch0_ef449738:

    # "不行，冷静……"
    "No, calm down..."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:35
translate english ch0_442941ca:

    # "……"
    "..."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:36
translate english ch0_48e597c4:

    # "僵持在此也不是个办法……不知为何，我完全无法控制身体，只能先试试跟她交流了。"
    "Standing in a stalemate here isn’t a solution either... For some reason, I can’t control my body at all, so I can only try communicating with her first."

