    # by eye_move o "这么看，这里应该是询问室了。啧……我怎么这么倒霉。"
    by eye_move o "So this is the interrogation room. Which means… oh, great. Just my luck."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:251
translate english ch0_8e6d8e32:

    # "白一坐在角落的凳子上，双手紧绷着握拳，似乎意识到什么，放低了说话声音。"
    "Bai Yi sat on a stool in the corner, clenching her hands tightly into fists. She seemed to realize something and lowered her voice."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:252
translate english ch0_13d3ab72:

    # "——刚才，经过短暂的对峙后，持枪的人扣住白一的手，把她拉到这个房间。"
    "Moments ago, after a brief confrontation, the gunman grabbed Bai Yi by the hand and pulled her into this room."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:253
translate english ch0_fe4c2f3d:

    # "在那之后，不知道他们又发现了什么，不再有人拿着枪对准白一，只是仍然不让她从这里出去。"
    "After that, I don‘t know what they discovered. No one was pointing a gun at Bai Yi anymore, but they still wouldn't let her out of here."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:254
translate english ch0_36577250:

    # "房间里只有空空荡荡的书桌和凳子，让头上的顶灯更加晃人心神。"
    "The room held nothing but an empty desk and a lone stool, making the overhead light feel harsh and unsettling."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:255
translate english ch0_b08faa32:

    # by eye_move e "可能有人正在看我……我会不会被当成精神病？哦，我可能就是。"
    by eye_move e "Someone might be watching me now...Am I going to look crazy? Oh. I probably am."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:256
translate english ch0_984712e9:

