    "Bai Yi had appeared out of nowhere, still unconscious. Given the oddity of the situation, the other party's questioning was only to be expected."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:268
translate english ch0_7b39d243:

    # "最重要的是，无论如何，在这个地方，白一并没有反抗的能力和资格……"
    "Moreover, the most important thing is that, Bai Yi has no ability or qualification to resist in this place..."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:271
translate english ch0_da58d533:

    # xp "前天的下午和晚上，你在哪里，在做什么？前天，12月10日。"
    xp "Where were you and what were you doing the afternoon and evening the day before yesterday? The day before yesterday, December 10th."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:272
translate english ch0_d3c0d4be:

