# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:287
translate english ch0_c57b9a3e:

    # by eye_def o "好吧……其实，我好像失忆了，不记得那天发生的事情。"
    by eye_def o "Well...actually, I seemed to lost my memory, and didn't remember anything on that day."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:290
translate english ch0_e0a90a99:

    # "房间里陷入沉默，但意外的是，这次对面的人并没有在第一时间驳斥白一。"
    "The room fell silent, but surprisingly, Xi Ping did not immediately refute Bai Yi."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:291
translate english ch0_dc8ee3cb:

    # "她只是拧起了眉毛，看着白一，似乎在等她继续说下去。"
    "She just raised her eyebrows and looked at Bai Yi, as if waiting for her to continue speaking."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:292
translate english ch0_637ed3ad:

    # "没得到反应，白一吞了吞口水，只好轻轻地、缓缓地吐出一口气。"
    "Without a response, Bai Yi swallowed hard and could only exhale softly and slowly."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:293
translate english ch0_09bc9def:

    # by eye_def o "呃，就是，我只记得周四的时候，我跟平时一样上学放学，晚上在家里睡觉。"
    by eye_def o "Well, I just remember that on Thursday, I went to and from school as usual, and slept at home at night."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:294
translate english ch0_c9405dc5:

    # by eye_still o "然后，睡着，醒来之后……就是刚才了。"
    by eye_still o "Then, after falling asleep and waking up... that was just now."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:297
translate english ch0_37693032:

    # xp "之前的事情全部还记得，只有这两天的事忘了？"
    xp "Do you still remember everything that happened before, except for these two days?"

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:298
translate english ch0_52cc8411:

    # by eye_def e "嗯……对。就是从，那天开始。"
    by eye_def e "Um...right. It started from that day."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:299
translate english ch0_d918404d:

    # xp "那么，周四没有发生过其他事情吗？任何不确定的细节都可以。"
    xp "So, nothing else happened? Any uncertain details you remembered are fine."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:300
translate english ch0_9c3f2fc7:

    # by eye_def def "……没有。"
    by eye_def def "...No"

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:301
translate english ch0_2b7d69c9:

    # "短发女人没再说话，安静地坐在凳子上，似乎在思考着什么。"
    "The short-haired woman said nothing and sat quietly on the chair."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:302
translate english ch0_33adb370:

    # "正当白一开始觉得不耐烦，要开口询问时，门再次被打开，另一个长发女人走了进来。"
    "Just when Bai felt impatient at first and was about to ask, the door was opened again and another long-haired woman walked in."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:305
translate english ch0_9e7fb21e:

    # "和西平不同，西顺进来后就对白一露出一个安抚的笑容，看起来温柔许多。"
    "Unlike Xiping, Xishun gave Bai Yi a reassuring smile as soon as she entered, appearing much gentler."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:306
translate english ch0_9e4db8e7:

    # "白一被轻轻拍了拍肩膀，似乎也没那么紧张了。"
    "Bai Yi was lightly tapped on the shoulder and seemed to be less nervous."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:308
translate english ch0_201d9f55:

    # xs "这位同学，知道“特调组”吗？"
    xs "This young friend, do you know “SIU”?"

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:309
translate english ch0_900a38b4:

    # by eye_def o "……啊？"
    by eye_def o "...Huh?"

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:310
translate english ch0_57d8a312:

    # "面对突如其来的问题，白一显得十分疑惑，但还是老老实实地回答。"
    "Faced with the sudden question, Bai Yi looked very confused, but she still answered honestly."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:311
translate english ch0_94b07374:

    # by eye_def o "当然知道啊。特别案件调查组……是吧。"
    by eye_def o "Of course. It is the Special Investigation Unit...right."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:317
translate english ch0_6da954e3:

    # by eye_still e "所以，是不是有什么危险的事情，跟我有关，所以你们才……？"
    by eye_still e "So, is there something dangerous related to me, so you guys...?"

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:318
translate english ch0_fe40613c:

    # xs "嗯，你说得没错。虽然不完全是，但是你那么想也没问题。"
    xs "You're right, but not quite. But it’s okay if you think so."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:319
translate english ch0_72ef8bd6:

    # by eye_still o "……哈？"
    by eye_still o "...Huh?"

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:323
translate english ch0_33dbf270:

    # "西顺忽然露出一个浅笑，眼睛直勾勾盯着白一。"
    "Xi Shun suddenly offered a faint smile, as her gaze locked onto Bai Yi’s."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:324
translate english ch0_8ca76fcc:

    # "深黑色的眸子在灯下隐约闪烁着反光，如同深邃的漩涡，摄取人的心神。"
    "Under the light, her dark pupils glinted with a subtle reflection. They like twin abyssal whirlpools, ready to consume one's very soul."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:327
translate english ch0_c26fdd6a:

    # xs "嗯，让我这样解释……特调组，还有另外一个名字。"
    xs "Let me explain that to you...There is another name...for SIU."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:330
translate english ch0_7c28e586:

    # xs "特殊怪异事件调查组。"
    xs "The Supernatual Incident Unit."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:336
translate english ch0_00b06a88_1:

    # by eye_wacky def "……"
    by eye_wacky def "..."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:337
translate english ch0_6e0a45a9:

    # "不知为何，白一的呼吸短暂停止了一瞬间。"
    "For some reason, Bai Yi’s breath hitched for a split second."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:338
translate english ch0_3933ad23:

    # "或许是一种说不清楚的直觉，又或许是因为，某个词让她觉得不安。"
    "Perhaps it was an inexplicable intuition, or perhaps because a certain word made her feel uneasy."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:339
translate english ch0_fbba93d0:

    # "但只是一瞬间。\n她很快又恢复气息，装作没有任何反应的样子。"
    "But it was only a moment.\nShe quickly recovered, masking her reaction as if nothing had happened."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:340
translate english ch0_3eb6ad79:

    # by eye_move o "……你跟我解释这个干嘛？"
    by eye_move o "...Why are you explaining that to me?"

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:343
translate english ch0_2debe5d0:

    # xs "嗯，这个啊，意思就是——"
    xs "Well, this one...it means——"

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:349
translate english ch0_7f32b7d4:

    # xs "你，或者说，{p}{b}在你身上的那个东西{/b}——"
    xs "You, or should I say, {b}that thing{\b} possessing you..."

# game/scripts/c0/c0.rpy:351
translate english ch0_ce2d9232:

    # xs "到底是什么？"
    xs "What exactly is it?"

